From 5a04cea260864041dcc4f2b56ca8b93e3f57afd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Pray <nickwpray@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:55:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fork: randomized gapless thinking-tone bank

The voice-mode thinking cue is now a bank of eight 3.25 s segments that
share an identical drone at their edges, played back to back in random
order with no immediate repeats. Web chains AudioBufferSourceNodes
sample-accurately; native enqueues one segment ahead. The bank loads
lazily on first use. Rebuild it with scripts/build-thinking-tone-bank.mjs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
